<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#d9c8f1">
<title>Whack-a-Mole 영어 단어 게임</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#4d4055;
  --muted:ㅁ#74677d;
  --lav:#d9c8f1;
  --lav-deep:#9d7bc6;
  --pink:#f3b6ca;
  --pink-deep:#df7197;
  --blue:#bfe4f5;
  --blue-deep:#6fb4d5;
  --mint:#ccebcf;
  --yellow:#ffe5a0;
  --cream:#fffaf0;
  --white:#ffffff;
  --good:#2da872;
  --bad:#e35d6a;
  --shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(83,58,96,.18);
  --soft-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(83,58,96,.13);
  --round-font:"Jua","BM JUA","NanumSquareRound","Arial Rounded MT Bold","Malgun Gothic",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{
  font-family:var(--round-font);
  color:var(--ink);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 8%,rgba(255,255,255,.95) 0 2px,transparent 3px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 86% 12%,rgba(255,255,255,.8) 0 2px,transparent 3px),
    linear-gradient(145deg,#eee3f6,#fff8e5 52%,#dff3e4);
  overflow:hidden;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
button,input,textarea,select,table{font-family:var(--round-font)}
button,input{font-size:inherit}
button{touch-action:manipulation}
.hidden{display:none!important}
.screen{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  display:none;
  overflow:auto;
  padding:calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-right))
          calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-left));
}
.screen.active{display:flex}
#introScreen{
  padding:0;background:#d9c8f1;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;
}
.cover-frame{
  position:relative;
  width:min(100vw,177.7778vh);
  aspect-ratio:16/9;
  max-height:100vh;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(82,58,95,.18);
}
.cover-frame img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.cover-hotspot{
  position:absolute;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);
  cursor:pointer;transition:.18s ease;outline:none;
}
.cover-hotspot:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
.cover-hotspot:focus-visible{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
#coverHelp{left:25.1%;top:82.7%;width:24.7%;height:13.4%}
#coverStart{left:52.0%;top:82.7%;width:24.7%;height:13.4%}
.cover-audio{
  position:absolute;right:1.8%;bottom:2.2%;display:flex;gap:8px;z-index:4
}
.mini-control{
  border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  background:rgba(79,60,91,.52);color:white;
  min-width:44px;height:42px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;
  font-weight:800;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(63,42,78,.24)
}
.mini-control:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);background:rgba(79,60,91,.65)}
.app-shell{
  width:min(1120px,100%);margin:auto;min-height:min(760px,100%);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;
}
.top-nav{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto 1fr auto auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.95);border-radius:24px;
  padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
}
.nav-title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(17px,2.2vw,24px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.icon-btn{
  border:0;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);
  min-width:46px;height:46px;padding:0 14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(85,58,96,.10);
}
.icon-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 16px rgba(85,58,96,.16)}
.panel{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.96);
  border-radius:32px;padding:clamp(20px,3.5vw,38px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.hero-copy{text-align:center;margin:0 auto 22px;max-width:720px}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:#efe5fb;color:#77569b;
  border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:10px
}
h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}
h1,h2{letter-spacing:-.04em}
h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);margin-bottom:10px}
h2{font-size:clamp(25px,4vw,40px);margin-bottom:10px}
.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,19px);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0}
.category-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;
}
.category-card,.sub-card,.choice-card{
  border:3px solid transparent;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:18px;
  cursor:pointer;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow);transition:.18s ease;color:var(--ink);
}
.category-card:hover,.sub-card:hover,.choice-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.category-card:focus-visible,.sub-card:focus-visible,.choice-card:focus-visible{outline:4px solid rgba(111,180,213,.45)}
.category-icon{font-size:38px;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.category-ko{font-size:19px;font-weight:950;display:block}
.category-en{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.35}
.count-pill{
  display:inline-flex;margin-top:12px;background:#f4eff8;color:#795f8a;border-radius:999px;
  padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900
}
.section-actions{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:18px 0 14px;flex-wrap:wrap
}
.soft-btn,.primary-btn,.secondary-btn,.danger-btn{
  border:0;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:950;cursor:pointer;
  transition:.16s ease;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow)
}
.soft-btn{background:#f0e8f7;color:#73558a}
.secondary-btn{background:#dceffc;color:#386b87}
.primary-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ef9fbe,#e879a4);color:#fff}
.danger-btn{background:#ffe2e5;color:#b84450}
.soft-btn:hover,.primary-btn:hover,.secondary-btn:hover,.danger-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.primary-btn:disabled,.secondary-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}
.sub-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.sub-card{text-align:left;position:relative;min-height:150px;padding:22px}
.sub-card.selected{border-color:#9f7ac9;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fbf6ff,#f1e4fb)}
.sub-check{
  position:absolute;right:14px;top:14px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#eee7f1;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:950;color:#fff
}
.sub-card.selected .sub-check{background:#9d7bc6}
.sub-name{display:block;font-size:23px;font-weight:950;margin:16px 0 8px}
.select-all-btn{display:block;width:100%;text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:19px;min-height:0;padding:14px 22px}
.selection-summary{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8effd,#eef8ff);border-radius:20px;padding:14px 18px;
  font-weight:850;color:#6f587c
}
.settings-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.setting-block{background:#fbf9fd;border-radius:24px;padding:20px}
.setting-block h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:14px}
.choice-stack{display:grid;gap:12px}
.choice-card{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:13px;text-align:left;padding:16px}
.choice-card.selected{border-color:#9d7bc6;background:#f5edfc}
.choice-icon{font-size:30px;line-height:1}
.choice-title{font-weight:950;font-size:18px}
.choice-desc{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;margin-top:4px}
.setting-summary{
  margin-top:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff5dc,#eef9ef);padding:16px 18px;
  border-radius:20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap
}
.setting-summary strong{font-size:17px}
.game-shell{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.game-top{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.90);border-radius:24px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow)
}
.game-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
.stat{
  min-width:0;background:#f7f2fa;border-radius:16px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center
}
.stat-label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:900}
.stat-value{display:block;font-size:clamp(18px,2.8vw,28px);font-weight:950;white-space:nowrap}
.timer-danger{color:var(--bad);animation:pulse .7s infinite alternate}
@keyframes pulse{to{transform:scale(1.08)}}
.progress-wrap{height:11px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.68);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 3px rgba(70,48,80,.12)}
.progress-bar{height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8ad2ed,#bd8ed8,#f1a1bf);transition:width .25s}
.question-card{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border-radius:26px;padding:14px 18px;text-align:center;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow)
}
.question-hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:850}
.question-word{font-size:clamp(25px,4.6vw,46px);font-weight:950;margin-top:2px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.question-instruction{font-size:14px;color:#715a7c;margin-top:4px;font-weight:800}
.mole-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(8px,1.4vw,18px);
  flex:1;min-height:0;
}
.hole{
  position:relative;min-height:clamp(155px,23vh,245px);
  display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;
  border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.26),rgba(214,235,205,.42));
}
.hole::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:10%;right:10%;bottom:5%;height:23%;
  border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#5a3a2c 0 38%,#7b5540 39% 56%,rgba(86,55,41,.08) 58% 70%,transparent 72%);
  filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 6px rgba(80,49,35,.25));z-index:1
}
.mole-button{
  width:100%;height:100%;min-height:inherit;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;
  cursor:pointer;position:relative;z-index:3;overflow:visible
}
.mole{
  position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:5%;width:min(72%,210px);aspect-ratio:.88;
  transform:translate(-50%,78%);transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),filter .18s;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 8px rgba(71,45,32,.22));z-index:2
}
.mole-button.visible .mole{transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.mole-button.ducking .mole{transform:translate(-50%,80%)}
.mole-body{
  position:absolute;inset:12% 4% 0;border-radius:48% 48% 38% 38%;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#b9825f,#80513a);border:4px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
}
.ear{position:absolute;top:6%;width:29%;height:26%;border-radius:50%;background:#966347;border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
.ear.left{left:5%}.ear.right{right:5%}
.ear::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:23%;border-radius:50%;background:#e8a7a6}
.face{position:absolute;left:19%;right:19%;top:24%;height:31%}
.eye{position:absolute;top:6%;width:12%;height:16%;border-radius:50%;background:#3e2e2e}
.eye.left{left:12%}.eye.right{right:12%}
.cheek{position:absolute;top:42%;width:18%;height:12%;border-radius:50%;background:#ef9da8;opacity:.9}
.cheek.left{left:0}.cheek.right{right:0}
.snout{position:absolute;left:35%;top:29%;width:30%;height:32%;border-radius:50%;background:#e8c1a6}
.nose{position:absolute;left:43%;top:26%;width:14%;height:12%;border-radius:50%;background:#74424c;z-index:2}
.mouth{position:absolute;left:43%;top:53%;width:14%;height:8%;border-bottom:3px solid #573841;border-radius:50%}
.tooth{position:absolute;left:44%;top:61%;width:12%;height:15%;border-radius:2px 2px 5px 5px;background:white}
.word-board{
  position:absolute;left:6%;right:6%;bottom:10%;min-height:34%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
  padding:8px 9px;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.98),rgba(236,231,238,.96));
  border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.92);box-shadow:0 5px 8px rgba(64,41,50,.22);
  font-size:clamp(14px,2.1vw,24px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:950;color:#5f5064;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere
}
.mole-button:hover .mole{filter:drop-shadow(0 14px 10px rgba(71,45,32,.28)) brightness(1.04)}
.mole-button.correct .mole{animation:bonk .5s ease}
.mole-button.correct .mole-body{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#86d5a4,#4aaa76)}
.mole-button.wrong .mole{animation:shake .42s ease}
.mole-button.wrong .mole-body{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ed8d94,#cc5863)}
@keyframes bonk{35%{transform:translate(-50%,-10%) rotate(-5deg) scale(1.05)}65%{transform:translate(-50%,5%) rotate(5deg) scale(.97)}}
@keyframes shake{20%,60%{transform:translate(-56%,0) rotate(-4deg)}40%,80%{transform:translate(-44%,0) rotate(4deg)}}
.toast-layer{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:80}
.toast{
  position:absolute;left:50%;top:18%;transform:translate(-50%,-10px) scale(.94);
  opacity:0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:12px 20px;
  font-weight:950;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:.25s ease;white-space:nowrap
}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0) scale(1)}
.toast.good{background:#e7faef;color:#217a54}.toast.bad{background:#ffe8ea;color:#b4444e}.toast.bonus{background:#fff2ba;color:#8a6611}
.modal-backdrop{
  position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(54,40,62,.56);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  z-index:100;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px
}
.modal-backdrop.open{display:flex}
.modal{
  width:min(720px,100%);max-height:min(90vh,850px);overflow:auto;
  background:#fff;border-radius:30px;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,34px);box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(38,23,47,.36);
  position:relative
}
.modal-close{position:absolute;right:16px;top:16px}
.modal-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:18px}
.modal-actions:empty{display:none}
.rule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
.rule-card{background:#f8f4fb;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;line-height:1.55}
.rule-card strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:1.08em}
.cute-rules .rule-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e9,#f5edff);font-size:16px}
.help-cheer{margin-top:14px;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e9f8ff,#fff0f6);text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}
.score-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px}
.score-table th,.score-table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee4f1;text-align:left}
.spell-modal{text-align:center}
.spell-clue{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7ecff,#eaf8ff);border-radius:20px;padding:14px;margin:14px 0
}
.spell-input{
  width:100%;font-size:clamp(25px,5vw,40px);font-weight:950;text-align:center;
  padding:15px 18px;border:4px solid #d9c9e6;border-radius:20px;outline:none;color:var(--ink)
}
.spell-input:focus{border-color:#9d7bc6;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(157,123,198,.14)}
.spell-input.error{animation:inputShake .35s;border-color:var(--bad)}
@keyframes inputShake{25%{transform:translateX(-8px)}50%{transform:translateX(8px)}75%{transform:translateX(-5px)}}
.spell-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.result-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.8fr) minmax(320px,1.2fr);gap:20px}
.result-card{background:#fff;border-radius:26px;padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow)}
.score-big{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,76px);font-weight:950;color:#8f69b0;line-height:1}
.result-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
.kpi{background:#f7f2fa;border-radius:16px;padding:12px;text-align:center}
.kpi strong{display:block;font-size:23px}
.kpi span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:850}
.answer-list{display:grid;gap:8px;max-height:55vh;overflow:auto;padding-right:4px}
.answer-row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;
  padding:11px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:#f8f5fa
}
.answer-row.ok{background:#eaf8ef}.answer-row.pending{background:#fff1f2}
.answer-mark{font-size:22px;font-weight:950;text-align:center}
.answer-word strong{display:block}.answer-word small{color:var(--muted)}
.answer-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}
.result-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.confetti-piece{
  position:fixed;top:-30px;width:12px;height:20px;border-radius:3px;z-index:200;pointer-events:none;
  animation:fall var(--dur) linear forwards;transform:rotate(var(--rot))
}
@keyframes fall{to{transform:translate(var(--drift),110vh) rotate(calc(var(--rot) + 720deg));opacity:.2}}
.footer-note{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:auto;padding-top:4px}
@media (max-width:860px){
  .settings-grid,.result-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .category-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .game-top{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .game-actions{justify-content:center}
  .stats{order:-1}
}
@media (max-width:620px){
  .screen:not(#introScreen){padding:8px}
  .top-nav{grid-template-columns:auto auto minmax(0,1fr) auto auto;gap:5px;border-radius:18px;padding:7px}
  .top-nav .fx-toggle{display:none}
  .top-nav .bgm-toggle{font-size:0;min-width:42px;width:42px;padding:0}
  .top-nav .bgm-toggle::after{content:attr(data-mobile-icon);font-size:18px}
  .icon-btn{min-width:42px;height:42px;padding:0 9px}
  .panel{border-radius:24px;padding:18px 14px}
  .category-grid,.sub-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}
  .category-card{padding:13px}.category-icon{font-size:30px}.category-ko{font-size:16px}
  .sub-card{min-height:108px;padding:13px}.sub-name{font-size:16px}
  .game-top{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto}
  .game-top .stats{grid-column:1/-1;order:-1}
  .game-top .game-actions{grid-column:1;justify-content:flex-start}
  #gameFxBtn{grid-column:2;font-size:0;min-width:42px;width:42px;padding:0}
  #gameFxBtn::after{content:attr(data-mobile-icon);font-size:18px}
  .mole-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}
  .hole{min-height:clamp(132px,20vh,180px);border-radius:20px}
  .mole{width:min(78%,160px)}
  .word-board{font-size:clamp(13px,4vw,18px);padding:6px}
  .question-card{padding:10px}
  .stats{gap:5px}.stat{padding:6px 4px;border-radius:12px}
  .stat-label{font-size:9px}.stat-value{font-size:18px}
  .game-actions .icon-btn{font-size:0;min-width:42px;width:42px;padding:0}
  #gameHomeBtn::after{content:"🏠";font-size:18px}
  #gameHelpBtn::after{content:"❔";font-size:18px}
  #gameBgmBtn::after{content:attr(data-mobile-icon);font-size:18px}
  .rule-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media (max-height:680px) and (orientation:landscape){
  .game-shell{gap:7px}
  .game-top{padding:6px 10px}
  .question-card{padding:7px 12px}
  .question-word{font-size:28px}
  .hole{min-height:145px}
  .mole{width:min(62%,150px)}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}
}

/* ===== 요청 반영: 주아체 · 단어 미리보기 · How to Play · 고퀄 두더지 · 전체화면 ===== */
html,body,button,input,textarea,select,option,table,th,td,h1,h2,h3,h4,p,span,div,strong,small,label{
  font-family:var(--round-font)!important;
}
.top-nav{grid-template-columns:auto auto minmax(0,1fr) auto auto auto}
.icon-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap}
.help-btn,#gameHelpBtn{padding-inline:13px}
.help-btn .help-label,#gameHelpBtn .help-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:400}
.fullscreen-btn{font-size:20px;padding:0;width:46px;min-width:46px}
.fullscreen-btn.is-fullscreen{background:#efe5fb;color:#77569b}
.cover-audio{align-items:center}
#introFullscreenBtn{font-size:20px;padding:0;width:44px;min-width:44px}

/* 소주제 하위 단어 미리보기: 마우스를 올리면 화면 안쪽에 자동 배치 */
.word-preview-tooltip{
  position:fixed;z-index:500;display:none;width:min(430px,calc(100vw - 24px));
  max-height:min(480px,78vh);overflow:auto;padding:15px 16px 14px;
  border:2px solid rgba(214,191,236,.82);border-radius:22px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(73,49,88,.25);
  color:var(--ink);pointer-events:none;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)
}
.word-preview-tooltip.show{display:block;animation:previewPop .16s ease-out}
@keyframes previewPop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(7px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.preview-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
.preview-head strong{font-size:19px;color:#765493}
.preview-count{font-size:12px;background:#f4eafa;color:#7f5c99;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 9px}
.preview-word-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}
.preview-word{
  min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;padding:6px 6px;border-radius:11px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8eb,#f5effd);border:1px solid #f0e5f8
}
.preview-word b{font-size:12.5px;color:#55405f;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.preview-word small{font-size:10.5px;color:#8b7595;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.preview-tip{margin-top:10px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9b7dab}
.sub-card{z-index:1}
.sub-card:hover{z-index:30}

/* 고퀄리티 두더지 스프라이트: 전체 몸이 보이도록 여백과 크기 조정 */
.hole{overflow:visible;min-height:clamp(180px,26vh,270px)}
.hole::after{z-index:4;bottom:2%;height:20%;left:8%;right:8%}
.mole-button{overflow:visible}
.mole{
  position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:4%;width:min(88%,235px);aspect-ratio:1/1;
  transform:translate(-50%,74%);transition:transform .19s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1),filter .18s;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 13px 12px rgba(78,52,37,.19));z-index:2
}
.mole-button.visible .mole{transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.mole-button.ducking .mole{transform:translate(-50%,80%)}
.mole-art{
  position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url("data:image/png;base64,");
  background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center bottom;background-size:contain;z-index:1
}
.word-board{
  left:16%;right:16%;bottom:11%;min-height:22%;z-index:2;
  padding:7px 8px;border-radius:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.97),rgba(247,240,251,.98));
  border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.96);box-shadow:0 6px 12px rgba(64,41,50,.18);
  font-size:clamp(14px,1.9vw,22px);line-height:1.1;color:#5f5064
}
.mole-button:hover .mole{filter:drop-shadow(0 16px 16px rgba(78,52,37,.25)) brightness(1.035)}
.mole-button.correct .mole{animation:bonk .5s ease;filter:drop-shadow(0 16px 16px rgba(50,151,100,.25)) brightness(1.06)}
.mole-button.correct .word-board{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#effff4,#dff8e8);color:#347252}
.mole-button.wrong .mole{animation:shake .42s ease}
.mole-button.wrong .word-board{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff4f5,#ffe3e7);color:#a94c58}

@media (max-width:620px){
  .top-nav{grid-template-columns:auto auto minmax(0,1fr) auto auto auto}
  .help-btn,#gameHelpBtn{font-size:0;width:42px;min-width:42px;padding:0}
  .help-btn::after,#gameHelpBtn::after{content:"❔";font-size:18px}
  .fullscreen-btn{width:42px;min-width:42px;height:42px}
  .preview-word-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hole{min-height:clamp(155px,23vh,205px)}
  .mole{width:min(88%,178px)}
  .word-board{left:14%;right:14%;bottom:9%;font-size:clamp(12px,3.8vw,18px)}
}
@media (max-height:680px) and (orientation:landscape){
  .hole{min-height:155px}
  .mole{width:min(72%,175px)}
}


/* ===== 모바일 가독성/겹침 보완 ===== */
@media (max-width:620px){
  /* 상단 메뉴: 6개 요소가 작은 화면에서도 한 줄에 안정적으로 들어가도록 고정 폭 축소 */
  .top-nav{
    grid-template-columns:40px 40px minmax(0,1fr) 40px 40px 40px;
    gap:4px;padding:6px;min-width:0
  }
  .top-nav .icon-btn,.top-nav .fullscreen-btn{
    width:40px;min-width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;gap:0;font-size:17px
  }
  .top-nav .help-btn,.top-nav .bgm-toggle{font-size:0}
  .top-nav .help-btn::after{font-size:17px}
  .top-nav .bgm-toggle::after{font-size:17px}
  .top-nav .fullscreen-btn{font-size:18px}
  .nav-title{
    min-width:0;font-size:clamp(13px,4vw,17px);line-height:1.1;
    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis
  }

  /* 카드 내부의 아이콘이 텍스트에 밀리거나 겹치지 않도록 크기/폭 분리 */
  .choice-card{gap:9px;padding:13px;min-width:0}
  .choice-card>span:last-child{min-width:0;flex:1}
  .choice-icon{font-size:24px;line-height:1;flex:0 0 28px;text-align:center}
  .choice-title{font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .choice-desc{font-size:12px;line-height:1.38;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .setting-block{padding:15px;border-radius:20px}
  .setting-block h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:11px}

  .category-card,.sub-card{min-width:0;overflow:hidden}
  .category-icon{font-size:26px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
  .category-ko{font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .category-en{font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .sub-name{font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .sub-check{width:26px;height:26px;right:10px;top:10px;font-size:13px}

  /* 모바일 제목/설명 및 일반 버튼 크기 */
  h1{font-size:clamp(25px,8vw,32px)}
  h2{font-size:clamp(23px,7vw,30px)}
  .lead{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
  .eyebrow{font-size:11px;padding:6px 10px}
  .soft-btn,.primary-btn,.secondary-btn,.danger-btn{
    padding:12px 15px;border-radius:15px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.2
  }
  .selection-summary{font-size:13px;padding:11px 13px;min-width:0}
  .section-actions{gap:8px}
  .setting-summary{padding:13px;gap:10px}
  .setting-summary strong{font-size:15px}

  /* 게임 화면: 아이콘 버튼은 아이콘만, 전체화면 아이콘은 숨지 않도록 별도 복구 */
  .game-actions{gap:5px;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}
  .game-actions .icon-btn,#gameFxBtn{
    width:40px;min-width:40px;height:40px;padding:0
  }
  #gameFullscreenBtn{font-size:18px!important}
  #gameHomeBtn::after,#gameHelpBtn::after,#gameBgmBtn::after,#gameFxBtn::after{font-size:17px}
  .stats{min-width:0}
  .stat{min-width:0;padding:6px 2px}
  .stat-label{font-size:9px;white-space:nowrap}
  .stat-value{font-size:clamp(15px,5vw,18px)}
  .question-word{font-size:clamp(23px,8vw,34px);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .question-instruction{font-size:12px;line-height:1.35}
  .word-board{
    left:12%;right:12%;font-size:clamp(11px,3.65vw,16px);line-height:1.05;
    padding:5px 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word
  }

  /* 결과/도움말에서도 긴 글자가 화면 밖으로 밀리지 않도록 */
  .modal{padding:20px 14px;border-radius:24px}
  .rule-card{font-size:14px;padding:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .answer-row{grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px}
  .answer-meta{grid-column:2;text-align:left}
}

@media (max-width:390px){
  .screen:not(#introScreen){padding:6px}
  .top-nav{
    grid-template-columns:36px 36px minmax(0,1fr) 36px 36px 36px;
    gap:3px;padding:5px;border-radius:15px
  }
  .top-nav .icon-btn,.top-nav .fullscreen-btn{
    width:36px;min-width:36px;height:36px;font-size:16px
  }
  .top-nav .help-btn::after,.top-nav .bgm-toggle::after{font-size:16px}
  .top-nav .fullscreen-btn{font-size:17px}
  .nav-title{font-size:12px}
  .panel{padding:15px 10px;border-radius:20px}
  .category-grid,.sub-grid{gap:7px}
  .category-card{padding:10px 7px}
  .category-icon{font-size:23px}
  .category-ko{font-size:14px}
  .choice-card{padding:11px 9px;gap:7px}
  .choice-icon{font-size:22px;flex-basis:25px}
  .choice-title{font-size:15px}
  .choice-desc{font-size:11px}
  .game-actions .icon-btn,#gameFxBtn{width:36px;min-width:36px;height:36px}
  #gameFullscreenBtn{font-size:17px!important}
  .mole{width:min(90%,165px)}
  .hole{min-height:145px}
  .word-board{left:10%;right:10%;font-size:clamp(10px,3.5vw,14px)}
}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">
  <section id="introScreen" class="screen active" aria-label="게임 표지">
    <div class="cover-frame">
      <img alt="Whack-a-Mole 영어 단어 게임 표지" src="data:image/png;base64,">
      <button id="coverHelp" class="cover-hotspot" aria-label="How to Play"></button>
      <button id="coverStart" class="cover-hotspot" aria-label="게임 시작"></button>
      <div class="cover-audio">
        <button id="introBgmBtn" class="mini-control" aria-label="배경음악 켜기 또는 끄기">🎵</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="categoryScreen" class="screen">
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="top-nav">
        <button class="icon-btn home-btn" aria-label="표지로">🏠</button>
        <button class="icon-btn back-btn" aria-label="뒤로" disabled style="opacity:.35">←</button>
        <div class="nav-title">대분류 선택</div>
        <button class="icon-btn help-btn" aria-label="How to Play">❔ <span class="help-label">How to Play</span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn bgm-toggle" aria-label="배경음악">🎵 ON</button>
      </header>
      <main class="panel">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">STEP 1 · 한 가지 선택</span>
          <h1>어떤 단어를 연습할까요?</h1>
          <p class="lead">대분류는 하나만 선택합니다. 다음 화면에서 소분류를 여러 개 고를 수 있어요.</p>
        </div>
        <div id="categoryGrid" class="category-grid"></div>
      </main>
      <div class="footer-note">엑셀 단어장의 실제 입력 단어 <strong id="libraryCount"></strong>개가 게임에 들어 있습니다.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="subScreen" class="screen">
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="top-nav">
        <button class="icon-btn home-btn" aria-label="표지로">🏠</button>
        <button id="subBackBtn" class="icon-btn" aria-label="뒤로">←</button>
        <div class="nav-title">소분류 선택</div>
        <button class="icon-btn help-btn" aria-label="How to Play">❔ <span class="help-label">How to Play</span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn bgm-toggle" aria-label="배경음악">🎵 ON</button>
      </header>
      <main class="panel">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">STEP 2 · 복수 선택 가능</span>
          <h2 id="subHeading">주제를 선택하세요.</h2>
          <p class="lead">원하는 단원을 여러 개 골라 섞어서 출제할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-actions">
          <div id="selectionSummary" class="selection-summary">선택된 단어 0개</div>
        </div>
        <button id="selectAllBtn" class="sub-card select-all-btn">전체 단어 선택하기</button>
        <div id="subGrid" class="sub-grid"></div>
        <div class="section-actions" style="justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:0">
          <button id="toSettingsBtn" class="primary-btn" disabled>모드 설정하기 →</button>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="settingsScreen" class="screen">
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="top-nav">
        <button class="icon-btn home-btn" aria-label="표지로">🏠</button>
        <button id="settingsBackBtn" class="icon-btn" aria-label="뒤로">←</button>
        <div class="nav-title">모드와 난이도</div>
        <button class="icon-btn help-btn" aria-label="How to Play">❔ <span class="help-label">How to Play</span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn bgm-toggle" aria-label="배경음악">🎵 ON</button>
      </header>
      <main class="panel">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">STEP 3 · 게임 설정</span>
          <h2>어떻게 두더지를 잡을까요?</h2>
          <p class="lead">모드와 난이도에 따라 오답 구성과 두더지 노출 시간이 달라집니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-grid">
          <section class="setting-block">
            <h3>🎮 게임 모드</h3>
            <div id="modeChoices" class="choice-stack">
              <button class="choice-card selected" data-mode="word">
                <span class="choice-icon">🔤</span>
                <span><span class="choice-title">단어 익히기</span><span class="choice-desc">한국어 뜻에 맞는 영어 단어 두더지를 잡습니다. 오답은 다른 단어로 나옵니다.</span></span>
              </button>
              <button class="choice-card" data-mode="spelling">
                <span class="choice-icon">✍️</span>
                <span><span class="choice-title">철자 익히기</span><span class="choice-desc">철자가 조금씩 다른 두더지 중 정답을 찾고, 이어서 정확한 철자를 입력하면 보너스를 받습니다.</span></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="setting-block">
            <h3>⏱️ 난이도</h3>
            <div id="difficultyChoices" class="choice-stack">
              <button class="choice-card" data-difficulty="easy">
                <span class="choice-icon">🌱</span>
                <span><span class="choice-title">쉬움 · 7초</span><span class="choice-desc">두더지가 오래 보여 처음 연습하기 좋습니다.</span></span>
              </button>
              <button class="choice-card selected" data-difficulty="normal">
                <span class="choice-icon">⭐</span>
                <span><span class="choice-title">보통 · 5초</span><span class="choice-desc">적당한 속도로 위치가 바뀝니다.</span></span>
              </button>
              <button class="choice-card" data-difficulty="hard">
                <span class="choice-icon">⚡</span>
                <span><span class="choice-title">어려움 · 3초</span><span class="choice-desc">빠르게 움직이는 두더지를 집중해서 잡습니다.</span></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
        <div class="setting-summary">
          <div>
            <strong id="settingsSummaryTitle">단어 익히기 · 보통</strong>
            <div id="settingsSummaryText" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px"></div>
          </div>
          <button id="startGameBtn" class="primary-btn">게임 시작!</button>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="gameScreen" class="screen">
    <div class="game-shell">
      <div class="game-top">
        <div class="game-actions">
          <button id="gameHomeBtn" class="icon-btn" aria-label="표지로">🏠 홈</button>
          <button id="gameHelpBtn" class="icon-btn" aria-label="How to Play">❔ <span class="help-label">How to Play</span></button>
          <button id="gameBgmBtn" class="icon-btn" aria-label="배경음악">🎵 ON</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">진행</span><span id="roundStat" class="stat-value">1/10</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">점수</span><span id="scoreStat" class="stat-value">0</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">연속 정답</span><span id="streakStat" class="stat-value">0</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">남은 시간</span><span id="timeStat" class="stat-value">60.0</span></div>
        </div>
        <button id="gameFxBtn" class="icon-btn fx-toggle" aria-label="효과음">🔊 효과음</button>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-wrap" aria-label="게임 진행률"><div id="progressBar" class="progress-bar"></div></div>
      <div class="question-card">
        <div class="question-hint" id="questionModeLabel">단어 익히기</div>
        <div class="question-word" id="questionWord">뜻</div>
        <div class="question-instruction" id="questionInstruction">뜻에 맞는 영어 단어를 잡으세요!</div>
      </div>
      <div id="moleGrid" class="mole-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="resultScreen" class="screen">
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="top-nav">
        <button class="icon-btn home-btn" aria-label="표지로">🏠</button>
        <button class="icon-btn" disabled style="opacity:.35">←</button>
        <div class="nav-title">게임 결과</div>
        <button class="icon-btn help-btn" aria-label="How to Play">❔ <span class="help-label">How to Play</span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn bgm-toggle" aria-label="배경음악">🎵 ON</button>
      </header>
      <main class="panel">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">RESULT</span>
          <h2 id="resultTitle">수고했어요!</h2>
          <p id="resultMessage" class="lead"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="result-layout">
          <section class="result-card">
            <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-weight:900">최종 점수</div>
            <div id="finalScore" class="score-big">0</div>
            <div class="result-kpis">
              <div class="kpi"><strong id="correctKpi">0/10</strong><span>정답 완료</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><strong id="timeKpi">0.0초</strong><span>진행 시간</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><strong id="streakKpi">0</strong><span>최고 연속 정답</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><strong id="bonusKpi">0초</strong><span>획득 시간 보너스</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="result-actions">
              <button id="retryBtn" class="primary-btn">같은 설정으로 다시</button>
              <button id="reselectBtn" class="secondary-btn">단어 다시 선택</button>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="result-card">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">문제별 결과</h3>
            <div id="answerList" class="answer-list"></div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div id="wordPreviewTooltip" class="word-preview-tooltip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div id="toastLayer" class="toast-layer" aria-live="assertive"></div>

<div id="helpModal" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="helpTitle">
  <div class="modal">
    <button id="helpCloseBtn" class="icon-btn modal-close" aria-label="닫기">✕</button>
    <span class="eyebrow">HOW TO PLAY</span>
    <h2 id="helpTitle">두더지를 콕! 잡아 봐요 🐾</h2>
    <p class="lead">뜻을 보고 알맞은 영어 두더지를 눌러요. 모두 10문제예요!</p>
    <div class="rule-grid cute-rules">
      <div class="rule-card"><strong>1️⃣ 단어 고르기</strong>배우고 싶은 주제와 단어 묶음을 골라요.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><strong>2️⃣ 게임 고르기</strong><b>단어</b>는 뜻에 맞는 단어를, <b>철자</b>는 바른 철자를 찾아요.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><strong>3️⃣ 두더지 잡기</strong>정답 두더지가 보이면 빠르게 콕! 철자 게임은 단어도 한 번 써요.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><strong>4️⃣ 속도 고르기</strong>쉬움 7초 · 보통 5초 · 어려움 3초예요.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="help-cheer">⭐ 정답 +100점 · 오답 -20점 · 3번 연속 정답이면 +50점과 +5초!</div>
    <div id="helpActions" class="modal-actions"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="spellModal" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="spellTitle">
  <div class="modal spell-modal">
    <span class="eyebrow">BONUS SPELLING</span>
    <h2 id="spellTitle">철자를 입력하세요</h2>
    <div class="spell-clue">
      <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:900">방금 잡은 단어의 뜻</div>
      <div id="spellKo" style="font-size:28px;font-weight:950;margin-top:3px"></div>
      <div id="caseNotice" style="font-size:12px;color:#9b5870;margin-top:6px"></div>
    </div>
    <input id="spellInput" class="spell-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="영어 철자 입력">
    <div id="spellFeedback" style="min-height:24px;margin-top:8px;font-weight:900;color:var(--bad)"></div>
    <div class="spell-actions">
      <button id="spellSubmitBtn" class="primary-btn">확인 (+50점)</button>
      <button id="spellSkipBtn" class="soft-btn">보너스 건너뛰기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

